tests/gate_capture_drain_structure.rs:1: //! Structural ratchet + functional oracle for failure-trace-capture PR-5:
tests/gate_capture_drain_structure.rs:2: //! `docker/qemu/lib/gate-capture-drain.sh` and its wiring into the gates
