docker/qemu/run-x86-boot-tests.sh:397: # of them here. The other three are the roots that are legitimately unretirable
docker/qemu/run-x86-boot-tests.sh:398: # at quiesce and are left shape-pinned, because which term holds a root is a
docker/qemu/run-x86-boot-tests.sh:399: # property of what the CPU happens to have installed.
docker/qemu/run-x86-boot-tests.sh:400: RECLAIM_DRAIN_PATTERN='\[RECLAIM_DRAIN:nested=1:context_violations=0:selection_capped=[0-9]+:injected=1:pend_epoch=[0-9]+:pend_hw=[0-9]+:pend_shadow=[0-9]+:pend_selectable=0\]'
