docker/qemu/run-x86-boot-tests.sh:444: # #822's oracle, on the same entry and the console's own foreground_pgrp
docker/qemu/run-x86-boot-tests.sh:445: # mutex. `fg_lock_touches=0` is the property, `fg_blocking_acquires=0` its
docker/qemu/run-x86-boot-tests.sh:446: # blocking subset, and `sig_calls=1:sig_pid=822:sig_num=2` is the injected
docker/qemu/run-x86-boot-tests.sh:447: # Ctrl+C still reaching the signal path with the right pgrp while a thread on
